-   insufficient as a full explanation; kept as a hedge.
-
-**What would settle it (deciding follow-ups, to be priced before more
-argument):** near-field imaging (s-SNOM) of x 29–45 µm through the
-encapsulant — resolves what both far-field modalities cannot (domain
-geometry now, including the sliver and any wall motion); Raman re-map of
-R3 through the encapsulant (stage-now vs stage-S1 direct comparison);
-transport cross-checks from the base recipe (per-branch LK mass,
-lower-T fan on ch_C).
-
-## Step 5 — The call
-
-**Per-region fused verdicts (strength scale):**
-
-- **ch_A: ABA — strong (Concordant).** Cross-modal agreement across
