-
-**What-would-settle (every unreconciled row):** ch_C — near-field
-imaging of x 29–45 µm; encapsulated re-map of R3; per-branch LK mass and
-lower-T fan. (Priced before further argument, per Next.)
-
-The fused "cannot tell" on ch_C and the traceable ch_B disagreement are
